interop 2 has the description "In particular:-A database of pan-European numbering resources; and-A dynamic database for geolocation and monitoring of spectrum usage opportunities.A dynamic database focused on specific frequency bands should help identifying underutilised spectrum and support more efficient spectrum use and sharing practices.".

